  "commander": "Sram, Senior Edificer",
  "description": "Targets Bug A from the May 14 audit (Carrion Feeder 7/7 from equipment+aura double-counting). Sram cantrips on Equipment+Aura+Vehicle casts, so the deck naturally piles both types of attachments onto a single creature. After May 14 fix, _get_equipment_bonuses filters by type_line so a single +N/+N gets counted exactly once. May 20 audit redesign: removed 12 off-color cards (Bear/Snake/Boar/Spider/Indrik Umbra G, Eel Umbra U, Karametra's Acolyte G, Eternal Warrior R, Akiri R, Cranial Plating B, Embercleave R, Carrion Feeder B). Sram is mono-white so commander color identity blocked all of them at cast time, defeating the test. Replaced with mono-white auras (Daybreak Coronet, Holy Mantle, Battle Mastery, Knightly Valor, Cathars' Crusade, Faith Unbroken) and colorless/W equipment (Maul of the Skyclaves, Sword of the Animist, Shadowspear, Glaive of the Guildpact, Trailblazer's Boots, Sword of Vengeance) that still stack aura+equipment on the same creature within ~6 turns of Sram cantrip draws.",
